          "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202309/bg2023091512.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>SES 是亚马逊的邮件发送服务，但是开通这个服务，需要写申请邮件，说清楚用途。作者分享了自己的申请经验。（<a href=\"https://github.com/ruanyf/weekly/issues/3487\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@tiezhudotwang</a> 投稿）</p>",
